ot - very hard to click with editable children.\n\nSo either ALL the children have to be locked at this point, or none of them. With no definable selectable area for the root node that overrides everything else, I have to keep editable children false. That means I can't fix this problem until the bug is resolved.\n\nHuge bug for my game. Big PITA.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120549240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120553302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102047#issuecomment-3120553302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102047","id":3120553302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65_91W","user":{"login":"CarterG81","id":17555008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTU1MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17555008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81","html_url":"https://github.com/CarterG81","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarterG81/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T22:23:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T22:23:03Z","body":"It would solve my issue if there 